PRIZM Racing for Rockbox (YP3 port)

Upstream (MIT, LICENSE): https://github.com/duarteapcoelho/prizm_racing
  commit b7e9ac33d8529e94c90d8a37e3f8edfe3e56e6ff
prizmracing.c is a C rewrite of the upstream renderer and driving model on
16.16 fixed point (no malloc, no float, no Casio platform layers; multiplayer
dropped). pr_data.h is generated by maketex.py from upstream's models.h and
car.png (texture shrunk to 128x128, 32 colours). tracks/*.trk are extra
tracks for the card. No license problems.
